OL,3,GNEWSAITV Wales plans to cut programmes
OL,4,Aand jobs
OL,5,
OL,6,FITV Wales plans to cut two programmes
OL,7,Fand reduce the number of producer roles
OL,8,Fin its Cardiff headquarters.
OL,10,FThe broadcaster said the proposals
OL,11,Fwould "help to ease some cost pressure"
OL,12,Fand would allow its English language
OL,13,Fteams to "work more flexibly".
OL,15,FITV confirmed it was proposing to end
OL,16,Fits long-running Coast and Country show
OL,17,Fand weekly arts and entertainment
OL,18,Fprogramme Backstage.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
